Subject: Allow linecache getline and getlines from the frozen linecache module
Description: Python 3.15 runs linecache from a frozen module, so the
 blocking calls made by getline and getlines must be allowed there as well.
Upstream: not yet reported

Index: b/blockbuster/blockbuster.py
===================================================================
--- a/blockbuster/blockbuster.py
+++ b/blockbuster/blockbuster.py
@@ -310,7 +310,7 @@
         can_block_functions=[
             ("<frozen importlib._bootstrap>", {"_find_and_load"}),
             ("linecache.py", {"checkcache", "updatecache"}),
-            ("<frozen linecache>", {"checkcache", "updatecache"}),
+            ("<frozen linecache>", {"checkcache", "updatecache", "getline", "getlines"}),
             ("coverage/control.py", {"_should_trace"}),
             ("coverage/python.py", {"get_python_source"}),
             ("asyncio/unix_events.py", {"create_unix_server", "_stop_serving"}),
